# Thinking: weight onto the left leg, the left arm across the belly holding the right elbow, the
# right hand at the chin; the head tilts and the eyes go up. In the loop the chin is tapped, the
# head tilts the other way and the weight drifts.
emote 13 Thinking
duration 5
loop 1.0 5.0
drag 0.04
touch hand.R head 0.03 1.2 5.0
pose think hips=3,-1,0 pelvis=0,6,-4 spine=2,0,3 chest=2,-6,2 neck=-2,0,0 head=-8,6,-8 arm.R=56,-34,16 fore.R=121 hand.R=-10,-55,0 arm.L=60,-46,24 fore.L=74 hand.L=10,0,0
key 0.00 rest
key 0.45 hips=1,0,0 arm.R=30,-30,6 fore.R=110 arm.L=26,-36,10 fore.L=70 head=-2
key 1.00 @think
key 1.60 head=-9,8,-10 hand.R=-12,-55,4
key 1.85 hand.R=-6,-55,-2                  # tap
key 2.05 hand.R=-12,-55,4
key 2.25 hand.R=-6,-55,-2                  # tap
key 2.90 hips=2,-1,0 pelvis=0,4,-3 head=-6,-4,8 neck=-3,0,0 hand.R=-10,-55,0
key 3.80 hips=3.5,-1,0 pelvis=0,7,-4 head=-10,2,4 chest=2,-4,2
